%% Authentication and ownership boundary
flowchart TB
  Browser[Untrusted Browser] -->|Firebase ID Token| Gateway[FastAPI Gateway]
  Gateway --> Verify[Firebase Admin Verification]
  Verify --> User[Current User UID]
  User --> Route[Authenticated Route]
  Route --> Owned[Ownership-Scoped Repository Call]
  Owned --> Found{Owned Resource Found?}
  Found -->|Yes| Service[Application Service]
  Found -->|No| Hidden[Indistinguishable 404]
  Service --> Model[Gemini or Speech Integration]
  Service --> Store[(Owned Persistence)]
